## Summary

Project audit after ~6 weeks of no doc updates on master. Found three feature branches with
submerged work, all parked on GUI verification. Actions taken:

- **PR #8 merged** (`claude/amazing-yalow-a5930c`) — Security fix: removes all `shell=True`
  execution, converts to argv. Fixes real command injection vuln (searching `firefox; touch
  <path>` created the file). 822 Python tests.
- **PR #7 merged** (`feat/cross-source-search-normalization`) — Search name normalization
  ("google chrome" returned only Flatpak, not AUR+Flatpak). 815 Python tests. GUI-verified
  by Vatteck.
- **Deleted** `claude/zealous-keller-c598db` (stale branch, no unique work).
- **Updated** STATUS.md + .last-agent to reflect actual state.

**Verification:** 822 Python tests + 62 JS contract tests green on master. CI green.

